WEBVTT

00:00:01.159 --> 00:00:05.610
kurts geredt, er traybt mir arayn in komendature,

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.270
in blok, in a BEDROOM.

00:00:09.647 --> 00:00:14.200
a tish, un es zitst, eyner a doytsh,

00:00:14.355 --> 00:00:16.171
zitst er oto do o.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:20.420
⟨in dem⟩ mundir in dem Natsi zitst er.

00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:23.720
zogt er mir... on keyn shum reyd...

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.841
zogt er, "her, JUD," makht er,

00:00:25.881 --> 00:00:29.739
"vi hot zikh dir ayngegebn bizl aher blaybn lebn?"

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:33.924
zog ikh, "⟨iz vos iz fun⟩ deroyf?"

00:00:34.099 --> 00:00:36.523
makht er, "ershtns hostu gefresn,"

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:41.970
zogt er, "umzist undzere shpayz.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:46.411
a JUD," zogt er, "tor nit lebn un tor nit esn keyn shpayz.

00:00:47.481 --> 00:00:51.021
du host gegesn," zogt er, "undzere grins, undzere shpek,

00:00:51.021 --> 00:00:52.790
undzere broyt."

00:00:55.193 --> 00:01:00.412
trakht ikh, "vu iz do shpek? vu iz do broyt? vu iz d⟨os⟩? BALANDA,

00:01:00.412 --> 00:01:03.813
 mit a shtikl broyt fun erza-" do hot men shoyn gegebn erzats,

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:07.728
fun OPILKes, vos me, me zegt holts, faln OPILKes;

00:01:07.728 --> 00:01:09.449
mit deroyf, mit klayen,

00:01:09.449 --> 00:01:12.343
fun mel klayen, vos me zipt iber,

00:01:12.343 --> 00:01:16.123
iz bakt men dos tsunoyf un zey makhn... zey zaynen dokh khimiker groyse...

00:01:16.123 --> 00:01:18.806
un me korme- un me kormet mit deroyf,

00:01:18.806 --> 00:01:21.461
 hodevet men on di gefangene.

00:01:22.075 --> 00:01:24.448
"ver hot dos," zogt er, "dir geratevet

00:01:25.298 --> 00:01:28.920
bizl aher? bist dokh durkhgegangen," zogt er, "azelkhe,

00:01:28.977 --> 00:01:33.730
, iberkukung." zog ikh,...

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:39.520
do iz shoyn nito keyn reyd im zogn, "ikh bin nit keyn yid." ⟨az ikh⟩ zol zikh oyston...

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:42.471
nor fun dest vegn hob ikh a zog geton, "⟨ikh bin⟩ nit keyn yid."

00:01:43.692 --> 00:01:48.293
zogt er, "her, drey mir nit dem moyekh. tu oyset dos o, dayne mayses."

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.891
zog ikh, "nu, gut, zol zayn a yid.

00:01:51.268 --> 00:01:55.280
nor mir hot geratevet," hob ikh gezogt oyf ANTONYUKn,

00:01:55.588 --> 00:01:57.809
oyf dem, der vos hot mir aroysgegebn.

00:01:58.693 --> 00:02:01.724
"ot der hot mir geratevet," zog ikh, "in Gorlovke,

00:02:01.883 --> 00:02:05.319
un zayn khaver in Gorlovke," zog ikh, "a STEPAN.

00:02:05.427 --> 00:02:08.289
zey hobn mir geratevet, bin ikh derfar do."

00:02:08.363 --> 00:02:12.330
zogt er, "du vest im derkenen, dem ANTONYUKn?" er zogt tsu mir.

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:15.480
zog ikh, "er iz a komisar. ikh veys nit. er iz,

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:17.632
er gefint zikh," zog ikh, "in Gorlovke."

00:02:17.632 --> 00:02:19.257
nor ikh hob ⟨im⟩ shoyn do gezen.

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:26.126
zogt er, "⟨az m'vet⟩ oysshteln," zogt er, "dir a, di gantse gefangene, vestu gefinen," zogt er, "im?"

00:02:26.588 --> 00:02:29.619
zog ikh, "neyn. mir," zog ikh, "shik nit oyf deroyf.

00:02:30.013 --> 00:02:32.250
mit ale..." zog ikh,

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.960
"ikh vel nit geyn zukhn," zog ikh. "er hot dokh mir geratevet, vel ikh,

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:40.604
vet men, genug," zog ikh, "vos m'vet mir teytn. vest dokh mir alts eyns hargenen.

00:02:40.965 --> 00:02:43.051
du vest mir hargenen?" tsu im zog ikh.

00:02:43.328 --> 00:02:46.494
zogt er, "oyb du vest alts zogn, vel ikh dir nit hargenen."

00:02:46.888 --> 00:02:50.630
zog ikh, "kh'hob dokh dir gezogt ver er iz.

00:02:52.002 --> 00:02:53.363
kh'hob dir gezogt!"

00:02:54.027 --> 00:02:59.780
makht er, "dos iz," zogt er, "nokh nit keyn reyd." er hot a ponem gevust

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.538
ver hot dos mir aroysgegebn. ken zayn, er hot gevust, ken zayn, er hot nit gevust,

00:03:03.612 --> 00:03:08.010
nor er hot ibergegebn durkh imetsn, oder er aleyn hot ibergegebn.

00:03:08.286 --> 00:03:11.790
kurts geredt, er hot a ruf geton dray soldatn

00:03:12.707 --> 00:03:16.919
un zey gezogt az zey, me zol makhn, ⟨az⟩ me zol makhn mit mir a sof.

00:03:17.635 --> 00:03:20.590
nu, do hot men mir a, gegebn a knak on dr'erd.

00:03:20.824 --> 00:03:23.453
m'hot mir ongehoybn poykn... zey zaynen gegangen

00:03:23.453 --> 00:03:26.420
in shtivl. bay zey iz geven kurtse shtivl bay di soldatn,

00:03:26.815 --> 00:03:29.947
mit azelkhe UNK ⟨KAK, a-⟩ azoy vi a TRAPETSIYA,

00:03:30.747 --> 00:03:35.180
mit ayzene untn di podeshve, mit ayzns ongeklapt.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.911
hobn zey mir ongehoybn poykn.

00:03:36.911 --> 00:03:38.706
bay mir iz avek glaykh blut

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.822
f- fun, fun tsure ergets tseshnitn.

00:03:41.822 --> 00:03:46.370
shrayt er, "nit HIER! nit HIER!" "nit do! oyfn gas!

00:03:46.828 --> 00:03:49.066
UNK farshmutsikn de- dem brik."

00:03:49.647 --> 00:03:51.683
⟨hot men⟩ aroysgeshlept mir oyfn gas.

00:03:52.363 --> 00:03:56.322
me hot mir mit koyekh... vos hob ikh shoyn gehat far a koyekh dortn o, bizl deroyf?

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:00.670
un m'hot mir gegebn a shtikl poyk mitn kop on boym.

00:04:00.868 --> 00:04:03.258
es iz geshtanen a lipe, a boym,

00:04:03.349 --> 00:04:05.283
a grobe boym. ikh gedenk ir.

00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:07.750
ot shteyt zi antkegn mayne oygn.

00:04:07.872 --> 00:04:13.060
un ikh hob farlorn mayn bavust, farlorn.

00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:15.999
az ikh hob oyfgeefnt di oygn...

00:04:16.832 --> 00:04:18.817
zey hobn gemeynt az zey hobn mir geharget.

00:04:20.055 --> 00:04:22.192
zey hobn... vi, vi ikh farshtey...

00:04:22.519 --> 00:04:27.090
zey hobn mir arayngevorfn in OTSEK, in dem

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:30.410
blok, vos s'iz geven arumgetsamt mit azelkhe drot,

00:04:31.007 --> 00:04:35.840
mit gedikhte. iz geven in, gufe in lager, in groysn lager,

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:39.310
iz geven oto der arumgetsamt

00:04:39.343 --> 00:04:42.492
b- bazunder arumgetsamt a kleyner blok...

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:46.870
aropgefaln.... iz der blok,

00:04:47.595 --> 00:04:50.238
in dem blok hob ikh zikh oyfgekhapt oyfn hoyf.

00:04:52.911 --> 00:04:56.803
ikh hob nit gekent iberkern zikh; mir iz umedum geven tutvey,

00:04:57.957 --> 00:05:02.237
un iber hoypt di kop, hot bay mir gerudert di kop,

00:05:02.985 --> 00:05:08.510
gerudert, nor ikh hob zikh ibergedreyt oyf, oyf a zayt.

00:05:10.849 --> 00:05:13.037
bay mir iz ongeshvoln der moyl,

00:05:13.836 --> 00:05:18.150
di tsure tseklapt. do iz, fil ikh blut mit zamd,

00:05:18.763 --> 00:05:22.351
un bay mir, ikh krikh arayn in moyl, bay mir feln tseyner.

00:05:22.476 --> 00:05:24.208
dray tseyner oysgeklapt:

00:05:24.838 --> 00:05:27.190
tsvey, dray UNK...

00:05:28.923 --> 00:05:30.700
ikh bin shoyn a gehargeter.

00:05:31.223 --> 00:05:34.470
"alemay bin ikh lebn geblibn," trakht ikh,

00:05:34.616 --> 00:05:38.030
"nokh a mol zol men mir hargenen?" hob ikh

00:05:38.997 --> 00:05:42.889
a trakht geton az ikh darf gefinen a mitl oyf endikn mit mir.

00:05:44.565 --> 00:05:46.871
ikh hob aropgeri- aropgenumen

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.111
fun danen mayn shtrikl...

00:05:50.303 --> 00:05:52.761
di hoyzn hot untergehaltn a shtrikl...

00:05:53.458 --> 00:05:55.375
un ikh hob avekgepoyzet

00:05:56.226 --> 00:06:01.780
un aroyfgekrokhn oyf di trep poyzendikerheyt un arayn in blok.

00:06:02.267 --> 00:06:05.390
kh'hob gemeynt az dortn faran nares.

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:07.540
dortn avu mir zaynen geven, di

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:10.547
algemeyne gefangene, iz nares drayendike:

00:06:10.553 --> 00:06:13.090
eyn nare, a tsveyte, a drite,

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:17.500
⟨A,⟩ un do iz in zaytn st- stolbes ⟨ts- un⟩ tsugeklapt,

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.575
shtangen un breter oyf, ongeleygt.

00:06:20.391 --> 00:06:22.106
hob ikh tsugepoyzet,

00:06:22.416 --> 00:06:24.480
un nito oyf vu tsu hengen zikh.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.443
nito oys vos tsu hengen zikh!

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:31.589
 hob ikh ongehoybn aroyspoyzen oyf kerik.

00:06:32.035 --> 00:06:38.340
un iz mir gekumen in kop az ikh darf araynkrikhn in lager in dem algemeynem

00:06:38.397 --> 00:06:41.985
un dortn aroyfvarfn zikh oyf di drotn

00:06:42.413 --> 00:06:44.347
vos firt oyfn gas.

00:06:45.315 --> 00:06:49.376
iz oyb dortn iz ELEKTRICHESTVO vet mir nit hargenen, elektrye,

00:06:49.568 --> 00:06:53.120
vet mir hargenen der vakh-man vos shteyt oyf di VYSHKes, oyf di,

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:56.008
oyf di hiltsene b- gebaydes, gebaydlekh,

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.049
⟨azoy⟩ mit pulemyotn.

00:07:01.515 --> 00:07:06.410
ikh gey arum perimeter

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:09.376
fun untn. ikh heyb di drot. ⟨es,⟩

00:07:09.376 --> 00:07:14.345
ikh, bay mir geyt blut, nor ikh vil nit filn gornisht nit;

00:07:14.345 --> 00:07:16.207
alts eyns geharget vern.

00:07:16.213 --> 00:07:20.700
ikh heyb, ikh heyb, un dortn fun tsofn-zayt... fun tsofn-zayt, fardreyt...

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:24.050
fun perimeter hob ikh gefunen a shlafkeyt in drot

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:27.150
un ikh hob dos di shlafkeyt m- mit beyde hent,

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.285
azoy ligndik oyfn rukn,

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.259
un ikh hob ongehoybn mit di fis

00:07:31.401 --> 00:07:34.500
pamelekh opshtupn zikh, opshtupn zikh,

00:07:34.894 --> 00:07:39.470
un ikh hob aroysgepoyzet. ikh bin aroysgepoyzet oyf dem zayt.

00:07:40.412 --> 00:07:45.310
un ikh hob ongehoybn poyzen un

00:07:45.627 --> 00:07:48.620
ikh bin dergangen bizl finftn blok,

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:52.761
nor ikh ze, ot do hot zikh, klapt zikh a tir. me geyt aroys, me ken mir derzen;

00:07:52.761 --> 00:07:54.040
ikh muz zikh shteln.

00:07:54.655 --> 00:07:58.935
un ikh hob zikh pamelekh avekgeshtelt un ikh hob ot azoy vi a shikerer,

00:07:59.211 --> 00:08:01.044
azoy vi a shikerer geyt

00:08:01.202 --> 00:08:03.862
bin ikh avekgegangen. ot iz der ployt:

00:08:04.425 --> 00:08:06.258
nem un varf zikh oyf im aroyf!

00:08:06.855 --> 00:08:09.410
VSЁ. UNK.

00:08:10.855 --> 00:08:12.891
ikh hob zikh nit ongenumen dos ton.

00:08:13.183 --> 00:08:16.360
ikh trakht, "bizl fartog iz nokh tsayt.

00:08:16.778 --> 00:08:19.700
a sho tsayt lebn iz oykh darf men."

00:08:20.355 --> 00:08:24.730
ikh hob nit gekent keyn mol gleybn az ikh vel gefinen a mitl

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.711
oyf aroysgeyn a lebediker,

00:08:26.852 --> 00:08:28.989
az mir vet imetser helfn.

00:08:29.535 --> 00:08:33.320
ikh hob far- farshtanen az do ken got oykh nit helfn.

00:08:33.332 --> 00:08:36.245
m'hot shoyn mir aroysgegebn; me hot shoyn mir geharget.

00:08:36.825 --> 00:08:39.395
m'vet mer nit, vi vet nor vern fartog

00:08:39.395 --> 00:08:43.335
un m'vet oysshteln, kumen di, di SVORe,

00:08:43.335 --> 00:08:45.276
m'vet oysshteln di gefangene

00:08:45.276 --> 00:08:49.880
oyf ibertseyln, vet men derzen az do o iz nito der gehargeter,

00:08:50.342 --> 00:08:52.069
vet vern aza min

00:08:52.069 --> 00:08:55.430
shtikl tararam, es vet vern aza min oyfzukh,

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.199
es vet vern aza min gelof,

00:08:57.199 --> 00:08:59.800
azoy vi zey hobn farlorn dem front,

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:03.240
azoy hobn, zey hobn far- z- zey hobn farshpilt...

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:05.152
mir hot zikh gedukht

00:09:05.597 --> 00:09:11.720
az zey voltn beser aropnemen finf divizyes, groyse,

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:14.280
a man fuftsik toyznt, fun front,

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.868
eyder lozn lebn a yidn.

00:09:16.245 --> 00:09:17.670
azoy hot zikh mir gedakht.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.701
nit umzist hobn di poyerim gezogt

00:09:19.701 --> 00:09:23.799
az di milkhome hobn di NEMTSes gem- ongehoybn tsulib deroyf...

00:09:24.379 --> 00:09:29.050
nit tsulib deroyf, tsulib di, geyn farkhapn lender,

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:33.050
nor tsulib hargenen di yidn. "ZA ZHIDOV MY,"

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.660
zogn zey, "VOEVALI PROTIV NEMTSEV."

00:09:36.664 --> 00:09:41.650
farshteyst? aza min agitatsye iz geven un aza min retsikhe ⟨k-⟩ iz geven tsum yidn.

00:09:42.098 --> 00:09:45.065
me, keyner veys bay hayntikn tog nit far vos iz dos.

00:09:45.065 --> 00:09:47.272
tsum bayshpil, nu, Hitler ⟨iz⟩ a meshugener,

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:52.630
ober di NEMTSes, di NEMTSes, ale biz eyne⟨r⟩ hobn dokh geshrien "⟨H⟩EIL!"

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:55.693
zey hobn dokh ale geyogt zikh hargenen a yidn.

00:09:55.885 --> 00:09:59.237
a kleyn kind hot bay zey nit getort blaybn lebn.

00:10:00.053 --> 00:10:02.443
yeder NEMETS biz eyner!

00:10:02.854 --> 00:10:05.940
tomer iz geven efsher a guter NEMETS, hot er im arayngezetst

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:10.700
ergets dortn in di, lagern. zey zaynen dernokh dem aroysgegangen lebedike.

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:13.120
zey hobn, zey, m'hot zey gemakht ZA,

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.403
ZA BLOKOVYKH NACHAL'NIKOV

00:10:15.797 --> 00:10:19.453
un azoy vayter. zey flegn shlogn di, di yidn.

00:10:21.383 --> 00:10:25.650
kurts geredt, ikh bin gegangen fun blok tsu blok, azoy gegangen,

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.215
vayle do iz geven,

00:10:27.357 --> 00:10:29.798
oto do o tsvishn finftn blok

00:10:30.124 --> 00:10:34.280
un zekstn iz geven der SANUZEL, der optret,

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.326
avu me geyt mit di baderfenish, fun,

00:10:37.326 --> 00:10:39.399
gemakht gevorn fun breter.

00:10:39.844 --> 00:10:45.069
iz bay der nakht hobn di gefangene gemegt geyn. ver tshepet zey? s'iz dokh,

00:10:45.413 --> 00:10:48.005
di VYSHKes, dokh ergets nit antloyfn.

00:10:48.248 --> 00:10:52.830
kurts geredt, iz di vakh-manes, az ikh fleg durkhgeyn afile

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:55.350
farbay MEZHDU BLOKAMI,

00:10:55.350 --> 00:11:00.662
hobn zey mir oykhet nit ge- nit, nit fa- zey hobn gezen, nor nit farshtanen, zey meynen az ikh gey,

00:11:00.803 --> 00:11:03.142
 fun shlof gey ikh ahin tsum optret.

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:09.330
 hob ikh gegangen, gegangen, gegangen farbay blok,

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.242
un ot iz der ployt,

00:11:11.434 --> 00:11:14.181
gel⟨ozn zikh⟩ vayter durkh, vilt zikh epes...

00:11:14.181 --> 00:11:16.820
ikh hob shoyn glat nit gevust vos ikh vil.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.178
ikh tsi di tsayt.

00:11:18.387 --> 00:11:22.262
un ikh bin dergangen tsu dem letstn... kh'hob zikh fardreyt;

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:24.033
se geyt a kvadrat,

00:11:24.192 --> 00:11:27.344
hob ikh zikh shoyn fardreyt. tsum bayshpil, ot ⟨iz⟩ gegangen azoy,

00:11:27.344 --> 00:11:30.150
hob ikh zikh shoyn fardreyt aher tsu di blokn un ikh gey,

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:33.315
un tsvishn di blokn iz di, der ployt zet zikh durkh,

00:11:33.422 --> 00:11:35.491
un ikh bin dergangen bizl aher.

00:11:36.004 --> 00:11:38.850
ot do iz shoyn gornisht nito.

00:11:38.873 --> 00:11:45.246
do iz nor der ployt, un do ⟨i-⟩ a VYSHKe a groyse shteyt, a VYSHKe vu der soldat mit alts.

00:11:45.319 --> 00:11:47.878
trakht, "ikh vel geyn itster hargenen zikh.

00:11:48.373 --> 00:11:51.300
⟨s'iz⟩ shoyn nito vos ⟨tsum⟩ kenen zikh UNK."

00:11:52.238 --> 00:11:54.442
un tsu dem blok bin ikh dergangen.

00:11:54.567 --> 00:11:56.046
do iz trep geven.

00:11:56.693 --> 00:12:00.560
trakht ikh, "ikh vel opruen." instinktiv, instinktiv.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:01.766
ikh hob gornisht nit...

00:12:02.734 --> 00:12:06.035
instinktiv hot mir getsit: "lig zikh."

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:08.347
un ikh lig zikh avek oyfn ganek.

00:12:09.147 --> 00:12:10.676
kh'hob kimat vi

00:12:12.083 --> 00:12:13.393
a fal geton.

00:12:14.614 --> 00:12:16.177
vifl hob ikh gelegn...

00:12:18.445 --> 00:12:22.800
un ikh nem, ikh trakht, "oy..." ikh heyb zikh oyfet,

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.914
un ikh ze ongeshribn: "lazaret."

00:12:26.882 --> 00:12:29.820
ikh hob gevust vos ⟨s'iz⟩ dortn frier a lazaret, nor ⟨fa- geven fa-⟩

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.023
itster hob ikh dokh VOOBSHCHE fargesn in alts.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:35.601
hob ikh zikh dermont az dortn iz SARKISYAN.

00:12:44.078 --> 00:12:46.502
ikh hob zikh dermont az dortn iz SARKISYAN.

00:12:47.132 --> 00:12:50.480
nem ikh, "ikh vel zikh geyn mit im,"

00:12:51.469 --> 00:12:53.015
trakht ikh, "zegenen."

00:12:57.358 --> 00:12:59.411
"ikh vel zikh geyn mit im zegenen."

00:13:02.843 --> 00:13:06.530
trakht ikh, "neyn. ikh vel aroysrufn efsher a khshad oyf im.

00:13:07.011 --> 00:13:12.690
halemay darf ikh geyn SARKISYANen araynsh- -shlepn in deroyf?

00:13:15.145 --> 00:13:18.176
un ikh gib a fal oyf der tir un ikh fal arayn,

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:19.948
kimat vi arayngefaln,

00:13:20.089 --> 00:13:24.690
un ikh⟨, un,⟩ azh a lof geton ahin o un ikh hob gefaln oyf dr'erd.

00:13:25.793 --> 00:13:27.390
geyt eyner aroys

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.799
un kert mir umet

00:13:32.391 --> 00:13:37.450
un derzen mayn tsure di gantse... es hot gebrent a lempele in der heykh; s'iz geven der koridor...

00:13:38.095 --> 00:13:40.806
un shlept mir aroyf in der heykh,

00:13:40.828 --> 00:13:45.320
oyf di, TO EST', shtelt mir aveket, un shlept mir arayn in BEDROOM.

00:13:45.486 --> 00:13:47.049
geshtanen a tish.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:51.431
dos ⟨hot zikh OKAZYVet⟩ der dizhurner,

00:13:51.431 --> 00:13:55.620
der dokter velkher bay der nakht, ⟨veyst⟩...

00:13:56.657 --> 00:13:58.558
zogt er, "KTO TEBYA TAK?

00:14:00.032 --> 00:14:04.430
TY," zogt er, "POLUMЁRTVYY." "du bist dokh a toyter."

00:14:07.238 --> 00:14:10.140
zog ikh, "gib a ruf SARKISYANen."

00:14:11.659 --> 00:14:14.251
"gib a ruf," zog ikh, "SARKISYANen aher."

00:14:15.777 --> 00:14:17.580
er hot gebrakht SARKISYANen.

00:14:17.869 --> 00:14:21.600
SARKISYAN hot mir SRA- lekhatkhile nit derkont,

00:14:22.594 --> 00:14:26.130
⟨nor az⟩ ikh hob ongehoybn reydn... ikh hob geredt nit mit dem GOLOS:

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.729
tseyner a p- dray iz nito,

00:14:27.729 --> 00:14:30.380
ongeshvolene lipn, di tsure tsehakt.

00:14:30.643 --> 00:14:31.936
a shepelyave.

00:14:33.023 --> 00:14:35.042
zog ikh, "host mir nit derkont?"

00:14:36.988 --> 00:14:39.820
zogt er, "ikh farshtey."

00:14:40.482 --> 00:14:42.399
er farshteyt shoyn vos dos iz.

00:14:42.996 --> 00:14:45.190
"kh'hob nit uspeyet. antshuldik.

00:14:45.679 --> 00:14:47.377
ikh hob nit," zogt er,

00:14:49.932 --> 00:14:53.350
"ikh hob farshpetikt. antshuldik mir."

00:14:55.281 --> 00:14:56.439
kurts geredt,

00:14:58.673 --> 00:15:00.692
zogt der dokter,

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.886
"vos vilstu mit im ton?"

00:15:04.073 --> 00:15:08.670
zogt er, "nit t- shikn z- nit traybn zhe, me zol im

00:15:09.135 --> 00:15:10.715
hargenen in gantsn."

00:15:11.683 --> 00:15:17.410
zogt er, "m'vet dokh morgn khapn zikh; m'vet dokh undz alemen tsehargenen!

00:15:17.708 --> 00:15:21.873
oyb m'vet pakn im do," zogt er, "vet min di k- nit nor undz,

00:15:21.873 --> 00:15:24.182
nor me vet di kranke oykhet tsehargenen."

00:15:25.048 --> 00:15:26.257
er zogt azoy.

00:15:27.512 --> 00:15:29.159
nem ikh, heyb zikh oyfet,

00:15:29.773 --> 00:15:31.454
un ikh hob ongehoybn avekgeyn.

00:15:32.288 --> 00:15:34.104
kh'hob gevolt aroysgeyn shoyn

00:15:34.414 --> 00:15:36.630
dem letsn gang maynem makhn.

00:15:37.688 --> 00:15:39.420
ikh bin dergangen tsum tir,

00:15:39.814 --> 00:15:41.512
ersht er khapt mir onet

00:15:42.227 --> 00:15:43.874
un shlept mir kerik,

00:15:44.691 --> 00:15:47.110
mir arumgenumen unter ⟨der⟩ hant.

00:15:47.442 --> 00:15:48.600
"kum," zogt er.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.890
"der dokter BOLDIN hot gezogt, m'vet a trakht ton,

00:15:52.352 --> 00:15:54.134
mir'n a trakh ton vos tsu ton."

00:15:55.997 --> 00:15:58.870
er hot im avekgeshikt un hot gebrakht

00:15:59.372 --> 00:16:01.104
Sashen ODINTSOVn.

00:16:02.106 --> 00:16:06.900
oto di gedenk ikh azoy vi itster di po- penemer zeyere.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:11.880
yeder zakh, a mentsh velkher hot dir geton guts oyf, oyf aza zakh,

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.896
iz fargedenkt men oyf eybik.

00:16:15.049 --> 00:16:17.270
gekumen a darer poyer.

00:16:18.103 --> 00:16:24.476
keyn sheyne zaynen mir shoyn dortn keyner nit geven, vayle mir zaynen ale geven gele, farfintsterte.

00:16:25.393 --> 00:16:32.199
der hot gekent, der hot gekent a bisl shener zayn antkegn mir az, i- a- antkegn an- nit antkegn mir, antkegn,

00:16:32.199 --> 00:16:36.030
 MELKONYANen, tsum bayshpil, vayle er hot nit keyn,

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:38.637
 DOBAVOCHNe hilf,

00:16:38.637 --> 00:16:40.300
nor er hot gearbet.

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:43.343
er hot gearbet in der komande, er iz geven a brigadir

00:16:43.348 --> 00:16:46.346
fun der komande vos firt aroys di toyte.

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:50.080
me klaybt tsunoyf di toyte, far tog, az,

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:53.860
far deroyf eyder me shtelt zikh oyf, oyfn,

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.353
oyfn iberrekhenen di...

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:58.513
kurts geredt,

00:17:00.342 --> 00:17:01.922
gebrakht dem Sashen,

00:17:04.223 --> 00:17:05.719
un mit dem Sashen

00:17:05.809 --> 00:17:09.549
hobn zey opgeton aza zakh... dos hob ikh zikh dervust dernokh dem...

00:17:10.617 --> 00:17:12.805
zey hobn genumen, SARKISYAN

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.287
mit Sashen ODINTSOVn,

00:17:15.512 --> 00:17:17.835
me hot genumen di DVUKOLKe

00:17:18.042 --> 00:17:21.850
oyf velkher me v-... s'iz oyf tsvey reder geven a, a vogn,

00:17:22.666 --> 00:17:25.545
un me hot aroyfgeleygt oyf im

00:17:25.553 --> 00:17:30.165
geshtorbene... flegt ale tog shtarbn fun DIZENTERIYA, fun dos, fun yents

00:17:30.165 --> 00:17:33.640
in lazaret... un UNK

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:36.246
avekgefirt a- a- ahin eynem.

00:17:36.353 --> 00:17:38.692
avekgefirt. s'iz dokh bay der nakht nokh,

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:45.015
un di vakh-manes oyf di VYSHKes zaynen geveynt gevorn az zey geyen, nokh az s'iz fintster,

00:17:45.015 --> 00:17:48.125
geyen zey zukhn, unterklaybn toyte.

00:17:48.452 --> 00:17:50.938
un fun andere erter iz zet men nit,

00:17:50.938 --> 00:17:53.930
di V-, ver es geyt un ver es fort, di V- di VYSHKes;

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:55.365
farshtelt fun di blokn.

00:17:55.489 --> 00:18:00.242
kurts geredt, yener ort avu ikh bin aroysgegangen, d⟨er SMERTNer,⟩ iz geven farshtelt.

00:18:00.872 --> 00:18:03.228
zey hobn untergerukt ahin a mes,

00:18:03.673 --> 00:18:06.650
a toytn, oyf mayn ort.

00:18:07.285 --> 00:18:11.710
mayn nomer, ⟨v- d-⟩ yenem nomer vos s'iz bay mir geven,

00:18:12.567 --> 00:18:16.192
vos s'iz geven farshribn mayn nomer oyfn nomen SARKISYAN,

00:18:16.192 --> 00:18:17.657
hot men oyf im ongeton.

00:18:17.967 --> 00:18:20.441
zaynem hobn zey dervayl gegebn mir.

00:18:22.557 --> 00:18:25.656
oyf, nor bay alemen iz geven opgerisene hertser.

00:18:26.286 --> 00:18:29.260
ikh bin geven oys mentsh⟨. zey dertseyln mir...⟩

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:34.906
er hot mir arumgekukt, er hot mir getapt, gekvetsht umedum, tsi tsebrokhene beyner bay mir.

00:18:34.906 --> 00:18:38.450
umedum vu er kvetsht iz mir tutvey. umedum.

00:18:38.503 --> 00:18:42.360
dem moyl, m'hot mir mit aza min geler,

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:48.183
 mit, gele, azelkhe vaser hot men mir, bagosn, un hot zikh gePENet un gedreyt,

00:18:48.544 --> 00:18:50.816
un er hot mir mit epes geshmirt.

00:18:52.408 --> 00:18:55.844
un es iz dergangen morgn...

00:18:59.057 --> 00:19:01.245
vart, s'iz nokh nit dergangen morgn.

00:19:01.403 --> 00:19:07.680
s'iz morgn ye, s'iz morgn ye. shoyn, b- bay der nakht, dos iz shoyn nokh, nokh tsvelf a zeyger alts.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:11.910
s'iz ergets geven a zeyger dray tsi tsvey a zeyger fa- b- bay der nakht.

00:19:12.777 --> 00:19:19.900
VOT. iz shoyn a, a zeyger fir hobn zey gedarft aroysfirn, tsi finf, di gehargete,

00:19:20.522 --> 00:19:25.545
iz hot er oyfgevekt di gantse komande zayne... s'zaynen geven zeks tsi akht man...

00:19:25.568 --> 00:19:30.711
un zey hobn avekgefirt, tsunoyfgeleygt di toyte, ongeleygt dem ve- dem vogn,

00:19:30.711 --> 00:19:33.307
un m'hot avekgefirt. un Sashe ODINTSOV

00:19:33.533 --> 00:19:38.340
hot kloymersht, er hot SLUCHAYNe, er hot, dos derzen,

00:19:38.983 --> 00:19:42.630
tsufelik, on, on, on tam.

00:19:43.995 --> 00:19:49.844
zogt, zogn tsveyen az zey veln loyfn im nemen, aroys⟨leyg⟩n un avekleygn aher. zogt er, "neyn.

00:19:50.357 --> 00:19:52.325
me darf a ruf ton dem dizhurnem"...

00:19:52.804 --> 00:19:56.630
dem di- dizhurnem MLADSHn ofitser...

00:19:57.107 --> 00:20:00.256
es dizhuret, bay der nakht a MLADSHer ofitser....

00:20:00.567 --> 00:20:02.417
"a ruf ton, zol er a kuk ton."

00:20:04.228 --> 00:20:07.676
er hot avekgegangen tsum tir durkhn vakh-man.

00:20:07.676 --> 00:20:09.740
der MLADSHer ofitser iz gekumen.

00:20:09.797 --> 00:20:12.727
zey hobn dokh shoyn ale gevust az m'hot a yidn geharget.

00:20:13.864 --> 00:20:16.861
hot er a kuk geton ahin, aher. zogt er...

00:20:17.256 --> 00:20:19.460
bay Sashen hot zikh opgerisn di yorn,

00:20:19.804 --> 00:20:22.700
vorem er hot zeyer shtark batrakht.

00:20:22.892 --> 00:20:25.451
dernokh dem hot er geheysn aropnemen dem nomer.

00:20:25.980 --> 00:20:27.762
hot er aropgenumen den nomer.

00:20:28.107 --> 00:20:30.860
zogt er, "DAS iz JUDEN.

00:20:31.178 --> 00:20:35.860
STIMMT. RAUS! nor," zogt er, "⟨d-⟩ di shikh zol men aropnemen."

00:20:37.725 --> 00:20:40.824
UNK genumen yenem, dem toytn,

00:20:41.927 --> 00:20:46.580
un me hot far mir, VMESTO MENYA...

00:20:47.277 --> 00:20:50.510
ikh bin, ikh bin geblibn dortn o,

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:53.565
a lebediker dervayl, a halb-lebediker

00:20:53.655 --> 00:20:57.288
bin ikh, un m'hot dos shoyn avekgefirt un arayngevorfn im in grub, im

00:20:57.288 --> 00:21:01.050
dem ershtn un dernokh dem di o oyf im, ahin, aher,

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:05.400
un m'hot mit a bisl zamd, ibergeshotn. zey hobn,

00:21:06.143 --> 00:21:13.545
oyf morgedikn tog zaynen zey, bay, b- bay alemen iz geven, ale zaynen geven zeyer, ⟨d-⟩ ibergeshrokn,

00:21:14.344 --> 00:21:18.945
i der dokter BOLDIN, i SARKISYAN, i Sashe ODINTSOV.

00:21:19.052 --> 00:21:22.370
zey hobn gemeynt, veyst dokh, NEMTSes,

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:24.631
NEMTSes gleybn keynem nit.

00:21:25.144 --> 00:21:28.125
⟨s'heyst,⟩ imetsn vet arayngeyn in kop, "A MOZHET...

00:21:28.637 --> 00:21:32.290
f- far vos iz er do untergepoyzet a gehargeter?

00:21:33.312 --> 00:21:36.259
vi hot er gekent unterpoyzen?" ken imetsn arayngeyn in kop

00:21:36.298 --> 00:21:38.030
geyn a kuk ton,

00:21:39.066 --> 00:21:40.460
ken men dos aroysshlepn.

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:44.291
nor es iz durkhgegangen etlekhe teg.

00:21:44.938 --> 00:21:49.370
me hot in der tsayt hot men ⟨U-⟩

00:21:50.220 --> 00:21:52.981
UNICHTOZHIT', me hot,

00:21:53.325 --> 00:21:55.563
dem lager, dem geto,

00:21:56.042 --> 00:21:59.950
me hot, oyf ibermorgn...

00:22:01.881 --> 00:22:03.917
es brent di shtot.

00:22:05.408 --> 00:22:10.633
ikh ze aleyn. mir f⟨ir⟩t unter SARKISYAN, tsum fentster,

00:22:11.179 --> 00:22:13.434
zogt, "gib a kuk: es brent di shtot."

00:22:15.094 --> 00:22:18.250
un a treskeray dergeyt oykhet aher in lager,

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:23.019
vayle s'iz nit vayt iberiks fun lager; m'hot dokh undz getribn grobn di griber.

00:22:23.633 --> 00:22:27.806
vos iz geven? vi iz dos, vi hot men tseharget di yidn in,

00:22:27.806 --> 00:22:29.764
in, CHENSTOKHOV?

00:22:29.764 --> 00:22:32.970
 ken, meg ikh dertseyln? tsi me darf nit?

00:22:33.268 --> 00:22:36.100
di yidn in CHENSTOKHOV... m'hot dertseylt, di komandes

00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:40.468
v- di arbeter-komandes vos zaynen gegangen in shtot hobn dernokh dem gebrakht di yedie

00:22:40.896 --> 00:22:42.240
az far tog...

00:22:42.718 --> 00:22:45.496
dos iz geven in SENTYABR' khoydesh...

00:22:46.296 --> 00:22:52.370
far tog ⟨iz⟩ geyen komandes, yidishe komandes hot men getribn arbetn, oyf arbet.

00:22:52.624 --> 00:22:56.630
der natshalnik, der, gubernator

00:22:56.630 --> 00:22:59.452
hot zikh gerekhnt a gants voyler NEMETS.

00:23:00.319 --> 00:23:06.151
er flegt nit lozn di yidn, me zol, shisn glat in der velt arayn. azoy dertseylt men.

00:23:06.394 --> 00:23:09.410
er iz geven a ELEGANTNer NEMETS.

00:23:12.604 --> 00:23:14.032
kurts geredt,

00:23:18.004 --> 00:23:21.950
me hot di komande, di komandes

00:23:23.539 --> 00:23:24.933
hot men geheysn,

00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:32.038
⟨hot⟩ men geheysn geyn oyf andere arbet, nit oyf shtendike arbet, velkhe me fleg zey traybn

00:23:32.432 --> 00:23:34.687
oyfn stantsye vu der ban,

00:23:35.858 --> 00:23:37.776
oyf di felder,

00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:40.450
dos aropnemen, yents aropnemen,

00:23:40.450 --> 00:23:44.040
oyf tsuklaybn, eynike UNK...

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:46.620
kh'vey- m'hot zey nit getribn oyf di arbetn.

00:23:46.620 --> 00:23:49.439
m'hot zey getribn ahin tsu di griber.

00:23:49.439 --> 00:23:51.545
m'hot zey gezogt, "oyf an ander arbet."

00:23:51.585 --> 00:23:53.081
m'hot zey opgenart.

00:23:53.475 --> 00:23:57.190
m'hot zey gebrakht tsu tribn, un me hot zey

00:23:57.897 --> 00:23:59.798
getsvungen oyston zikh,

00:24:00.411 --> 00:24:05.028
un me hot zey alemen tseharget. me hot tsugetribn nit glaykh ale komandes:

00:24:05.136 --> 00:24:07.681
ot me brengt a partye fun a fuftsik man,

00:24:07.681 --> 00:24:09.588
vayter a partye fun a fuftsik man,

00:24:09.588 --> 00:24:11.655
un azoy hot men tseharget

00:24:11.655 --> 00:24:16.340
di arbeter, di feike, di feike, di shtarke yidn hot men tseharget.

00:24:16.577 --> 00:24:22.510
iz geblibn in di lagern di kinder, di vayber mit di alte layt.

00:24:23.260 --> 00:24:27.995
ot do hot men shoyn ongehoybn untertraybn ahin gaz-mashines,

00:24:28.491 --> 00:24:31.134
un me hot zey gevorfn in di mashines.

00:24:31.495 --> 00:24:34.020
di vos kenen geyn flegt men ahin arayntraybn,

00:24:34.127 --> 00:24:37.074
un me hot gefirt azoy POTOKOM hot men gefirt

00:24:37.198 --> 00:24:39.284
ahin tsu di griber,

00:24:39.358 --> 00:24:42.659
un me hot farvorfn di griber mit CHENSTOKHOVer yidn.

00:24:43.932 --> 00:24:47.830
azoy iz nit gevorn di yidn in CHENSTOKHOV.

00:24:48.572 --> 00:24:51.430
un azoy, du host gehat dos, di

00:24:51.492 --> 00:24:54.300
tsveyte falshe nomen fun dem...?

00:24:54.158 --> 00:25:00.126
ye, DA., iz durkhgegangen nokh a bisl tsayt. me hot nit getort haltn dem nomen fun dem toytn,

00:25:00.469 --> 00:25:03.568
vorem der toyter iz gekumen fun a blok.

00:25:04.047 --> 00:25:07.292
in a blok iz faran a, an elterer fun a blok,

00:25:07.292 --> 00:25:09.097
bay vemen iz faran a bukh

00:25:09.097 --> 00:25:10.751
vu s'iz farshribn

00:25:10.751 --> 00:25:14.886
yeder nomer un yeder, vi me ruft im,

00:25:14.886 --> 00:25:19.464
yedern. iz farshribn gevorn dortn o yeder mentsh.

00:25:20.517 --> 00:25:25.870
NEMETSKAYA ⟨P-⟩ PUNKTUAL'NOST', NEMETSKAYA T- NEMETSKer TOCHNekeyt.

00:25:26.440 --> 00:25:32.910
UNK farshteyst? iz me k- keyn sakh tor er nit lign, in lazaret.

00:25:33.156 --> 00:25:36.216
hot men do gikh gedarft makhn mir

00:25:36.216 --> 00:25:39.750
naye, a nayem nomer; dos iz mayn pasport,

00:25:39.822 --> 00:25:41.132
mayn dokument.

00:25:41.543 --> 00:25:42.921
kurts geredt,

00:25:43.163 --> 00:25:47.910
es iz durkhgegangen a por vokhn tsayt. ikh hob shoyn ⟨on- ge⟩kumen tsu zikh.

00:25:48.141 --> 00:25:53.200
m'hot shoyn fun mir aropgeshlept... m'hot gemeynt az ikh vel sht- er hot gemeynt, mir hot BOLDIN zikh PRIZNAet, mir gezogt,

00:25:53.200 --> 00:25:56.430
az "ikh hob gemeynt az du vest shtarbn," zogt er. "ikh hob dir kam aroysgeshlept."

00:25:56.916 --> 00:26:00.979
"un du flegst," zogt er, "bredyen. mir hobn moyre gehat, zolst nit reydn az du bist a yid."

00:26:00.979 --> 00:26:03.469
un, s'iz geven tsores.

00:26:03.469 --> 00:26:05.786
 "du bist gelegn," zogt er, "oto do o.

00:26:06.062 --> 00:26:07.760
mit undz ⟨bistu⟩ geshlofn."

00:26:08.020 --> 00:26:10.438
kurts geredt, m'hot mir gegebn...

00:26:10.438 --> 00:26:13.869
es iz geven fun finftn blok iz geven dortn a polkovnik,

00:26:14.213 --> 00:26:17.694
iz er geven an ARMYANIN. er iz geven... tsi a GRUZIN;

00:26:17.694 --> 00:26:20.720
ikh gedenk shoyn nit. nor er iz geven der blokover.

00:26:20.777 --> 00:26:23.052
er iz geven a reyner

00:26:23.052 --> 00:26:24.990
mentsh a sovetisher.

00:26:25.587 --> 00:26:31.318
er hot dos mir oysgemakht a, fun a, ongekumen a naye partye fun gefangene,

00:26:31.510 --> 00:26:37.860
hot er arayngerukt oto dem a nayem nomer shoyn: zibetsn toyznt fir hundert I zibetsik nayn.

00:26:38.361 --> 00:26:41.274
SEMNADTSAT' TYSYACH CHETYRESTA SEM'DESYAT DEVYAT'.

00:26:41.618 --> 00:26:47.467
dos iz, vel ikh fargedenken bizl SAM⟨en⟩ toyt, funem ershtn⟨, dokh,⟩ in mitn nakht, ven ⟨vest⟩

00:26:47.524 --> 00:26:51.840
⟨mir,...⟩ SEMNADTSAT' TYSYACH CHETYRESTA SEM'DESYAT DEVYAT'

00:26:51.945 --> 00:26:53.537
bin ikh shoyn gevorn.

00:26:53.537 --> 00:26:55.770
es iz durkhgegangen a bisl tsayt.

00:26:55.843 --> 00:26:57.946
zogt mir MELKONYAN,

00:26:58.425 --> 00:27:03.170
"es darf zayn a partye, velkhe me shikt aveket di NATSMENes

00:27:03.170 --> 00:27:05.982
shikt men avek," makht er, "in GERMANIYA.

00:27:05.982 --> 00:27:07.768
dir tor men do nit haltn.

00:27:07.977 --> 00:27:09.703
m'vet dir pakn do o,

00:27:09.703 --> 00:27:14.602
vorem oft kumt aher," zogt er,י "a farreter, dos, yents, UNK undz alemen tsehargenen.

00:27:15.013 --> 00:27:20.930
mir'n... itster," zogt er, "mit dem finftn blok"... un eyn blok iz a rusisher...

00:27:21.038 --> 00:27:23.428
"tsvey blokn shikt men aveket,

00:27:23.653 --> 00:27:28.552
iz du vest darfn oykhet avekgeyn ahin o. mir ho- ikh hob dos ibergegebn,"

00:27:28.552 --> 00:27:32.330
zogt er, "dem ⟨ST-⟩ eltern fun blok. er veyst dos."

00:27:33.137 --> 00:27:34.914
nu, s'iz gekumen di tsayt,

00:27:34.914 --> 00:27:36.826
hot er mir gegebn a lebl broyt,

00:27:37.137 --> 00:27:40.890
a kleyn leb⟨elekh⟩, hot mir gegebn a shinel oyf onton,

00:27:40.890 --> 00:27:43.816
a mantl aza. kh'hob UNK dos nit gehat, a VOENNem; bay mir iz

00:27:43.816 --> 00:27:46.699
alts geblibn, dortn o in,

00:27:46.840 --> 00:27:48.876
in mayn, in traktor.

00:27:48.949 --> 00:27:55.340
kurts geredt, m'hot mir gegebn a KOTELOK, a lefl, sh-, shikh. dortn ⟨iz dokh, a sakh zaynen⟩ geshtorbn dokh, iz geven shoy-

00:27:55.340 --> 00:27:56.638
shoyn vos tsu onton.

00:27:57.235 --> 00:28:02.320
un ⟨hot mir,⟩ in a fartog aroysgefirt

00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:04.738
un gezogt azoy: "gey farbay di blokn

00:28:05.757 --> 00:28:07.618
un kum ahin o," zogt er.

00:28:07.618 --> 00:28:11.099
"on-o shteyen," zogt er, "shoyn mentshn fun zekstn blok.

00:28:11.173 --> 00:28:12.770
der finfter vet tsugeyn."
